WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.089 --> 00:00:02.698
Laghu Chaityavandan Vidhi 

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.270
Say 3 times Khamasamno Sutra

00:00:05.270 --> 00:00:06.647
Then give 3 Khamasamno.

00:00:10.841 --> 00:00:12.841
Then, in the Yoga Mudra,

00:00:13.050 --> 00:00:14.773
recite the "Arihant Chheyaṇam Sutra"

00:00:14.773 --> 00:00:16.482
and "Annatth Sutra"

00:00:16.654 --> 00:00:18.654
chat 1 Navkar Mantra in 1 Kausagga

00:00:18.822 --> 00:00:20.487
say "Namo Arihantaṇaṁ"

00:00:20.729 --> 00:00:21.868
After completing Kausagga,

00:00:21.868 --> 00:00:22.923
with join hands

00:00:23.034 --> 00:00:24.026
in the Yoga Mudra,

00:00:24.236 --> 00:00:25.747
recite Stuti or Thoy

00:00:26.231 --> 00:00:27.774
Then give 1 Khamasamno.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:31.858
say "Aviḍhi Asaṭhana 
 Michchhami Dukkadam"

